    "body": "The default would be ASCII, since that's what happens for URLs today. The other thing I was thinking of for `URLHost` would be public suffix stuff, but that could be done in a static too I suppose, would have to look into the API.\n\nPerhaps the current situation is fine, and we just need to add `URLUtils.prototype.toString({as:\"unicode\"})` or some such for serializing URLs.\n",
